.TH SPACECEW 1 "2026-10-13" "spacecrew 1.2.16" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
spacecrew \- Track people in space, NASA APOD, launches, ISS position, and space weather

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B spacecrew
[\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR]
[\fB\-\-mode\fR \fIMODE\fR]
[\fB\-\-no\-cache\fR]
[\fB\-\-clear\-cache\fR]
[\fB\-\-offline\fR]
[\fB\-\-no\-image\fR]
[\fB\-\-json\fR]
[\fB\-\-config\fR \fIDIR\fR]
[\fB\-\-generate\-completion\fR \fI{\fBbash\fR|\fBzsh\fR|\fBfish\fR}\fR]

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B spacecrew
is a terminal application for tracking people in space, viewing NASA's
Astronomy Picture of the Day (APOD), upcoming rocket launches, ISS position,
space weather, and satellite passes.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Display the version number and exit.

.TP
\fB\-\-mode\fR \fIMODE\fR
Start directly in a specific mode. Valid modes:
dashboard, people, apod, launches, iss, weather, passes.

.TP
\fB\-\-no\-cache\fR
Disable persistent cache for this run.

.TP
\fB\-\-clear\-cache\fR
Clear expired cache entries and exit.

.TP
\fB\-\-offline\fR
Offline mode: use only cached data, no network requests.

.TP
\fB\-\-no\-image\fR
Skip astronaut/APOD photo rendering (faster, no Pillow/chafa needed).

.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print mode output as JSON and exit (requires \fB\-\-mode\fR passes|people|launches).

.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fIDIR\fR
Use a custom config/cache dir (overrides \fI~/.config/spacecrew\fR).
Also honored via \fBSPACE_CREW_CONFIG_DIR\fR or \fBXDG_CONFIG_HOME\fR.
Useful for testing without touching real user data.

.TP
\fB\-\-generate\-completion\fR \fI{\fBbash\fR|\fBzsh\fR|\fBfish\fR}\fR
Generate shell completion script for the specified shell (bash, zsh, or fish)
and print it to stdout. Redirect output to a file to install.

.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
\fBspacecrew\fR
Launch interactive menu.

.TP
\fBspacecrew \-\-mode passes\fR
Show satellite pass predictions.

.TP
\fBspacecrew \-\-mode passes \-\-offline\fR
Show satellite passes using cached data only.

.TP
\fBspacecrew \-\-generate\-completion bash\fR
Generate bash completion script.

.TP
\fBspacecrew \-\-generate\-completion zsh > \fI~/.config/zsh/completions/_spacecrew\fR
Install zsh completion.

.TP
\fBspacecrew \-\-generate\-completion fish > \fI~/.config/fish/completions/spacecrew.fish\fR
Install fish completion.

.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
\fBNASA_API_KEY\fR
Optional NASA API key for APOD and space weather (DONKI). Defaults to DEMO_KEY.
.TP
\fI~/.config/spacecrew/config.toml\fR
Configuration file (theme, observer location, favorites).

.SH FILES
.TP
\fI~/.config/spacecrew/cache.db\fR
Cache database.

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR argcomplete (1),
.BR rich (1)

